# Directories the download watcher keeps an eye on, searched recursively.
# One path per line. Blank lines and # comments are ignored.
# $HOME and a leading ~ are both expanded. Missing directories are skipped.
#
# Only files arriving with spaces in the name are touched. Anything already
# here keeps its name unless something rewrites it.
#
# Directories are watched RECURSIVELY, and inotify pays per directory in the
# tree: a huge tree (a populated ~/Documents can be 100k directories) takes
# tens of seconds to establish watches and eats the inotify watch budget.
# Keep this list to trees that stay small. Downloads is where browsers save,
# including the Print -> "Save as PDF" flow.

~/Downloads
# ~/Documents   # opt in if your Documents tree is modest
